> EXPLAIN (COSTS OFF) SELECT * FROM n3 a, n4 b WHERE a.x = b.x AND a.x = 'A1' COLLATE ci
QUERY PLAN:text
Hash Join
  Hash Cond: (b.x = a.x)
  ->  Seq Scan on n4 b
  ->  Hash
        ->  Seq Scan on n3 a
              Filter: (x = 'A1'::text COLLATE ci)
