QUERY PLAN:text
Nested Loop Semi Join
  ->  Seq Scan on n1
        Filter: (x = 'D2'::text COLLATE ci)
  ->  Materialize
        ->  Seq Scan on n2
              Filter: (x = 'D2'::text COLLATE ci)
